# One phase per feature-hour, plus a guaranteed digest.
# Each phase is its own `claude -p` session: cost is roughly quadratic in
# session length (one 350-turn session measured at 53.5M tokens for 222K of
# output), so an 8-hour single session is the failure mode this avoids.
# `!digest` runs even after a failed or budget-exhausted phase.
slice
feature-1
feature-2
feature-3
feature-4
feature-5
feature-6
feature-7
feature-8
!digest
